WEBVTT

00:24:24.204 --> 00:24:31.913
I succeeded. And you know, it's funny,
as I say, these words, you know,

00:24:32.121 --> 00:24:36.413
the female in me, the woman who was
raised as a girl, is like, Oh,

00:24:36.413 --> 00:24:39.704
don't say that. Don't say you want
to be a great American writer

00:24:40.538 --> 00:24:44.163
because that seems cocky or that you're
bragging or but I'll tell you, like,

00:24:44.371 --> 00:24:45.954
that's the thing that got me through.

00:24:46.204 --> 00:24:51.079
Is that that like, again, the intention,
the plan, the ambition,

00:24:51.454 --> 00:24:54.454
if I sort of dithered around
and said, well, you know,

00:24:54.454 --> 00:24:57.079
I hope that this turns out and
I hope I can, you know,

00:24:57.079 --> 00:25:00.996
publish a story like I would never, ever,
ever be talking to you right now.